1
00:00:00,286 --> 00:00:04,206
(Leonard:)I thought I could try to analyze you
and get to the root of your anxiety.

2
00:00:04,416 --> 00:00:07,546
(Sheldon:)What qualifies you to attempt
to understand my mind?

3
00:00:07,710 --> 00:00:10,170
(Leonard:)My mother is a highly regarded
psychiatrist...

4
00:00:10,338 --> 00:00:12,338
(Leonard:)...and I've been in therapy
ever since...

5
00:00:12,507 --> 00:00:15,677
(Leonard:)...she accused me
of breast feeding co-dependently.

6
00:00:17,804 --> 00:00:21,974
And Raj says he can teach you--
What did you call it?

7
00:00:22,142 --> 00:00:25,352
(Sheldon:)I don't know,
some Indian meditation crap.

8
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:31,360
I see. I assume since the rest of you
have set the bar so low...

9
00:00:31,526 --> 00:00:34,366
(Sheldon:)...you're saving the most impressive
contribution for last.

10
00:00:34,529 --> 00:00:37,529
(Sheldon:)Go ahead, Howard. Dazzle me.

11
00:00:39,242 --> 00:00:43,412
(Howard:)My power is the ability to pretend
like I give a damn...

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:47,210
(Howard:)...about your piddly-ass problems.

13
00:00:51,004 --> 00:00:53,674
And that's 24/7, buddy.

14
00:00:55,383 --> 00:00:57,763
And I appreciate the pretense.

15
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:02,060
(Penny:)So, what do you say, Sheldon?
Are we your X-Men?

